{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "27", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "17", "M": "00", "S": "22"}}, "news": [{"title": "Dholera no longer speculative, manufacturing to drive real estate demand: Gopal Goswami", "para": "Speaking during a fireside chat at ETRealty Realty and Beyond Ahmedabad, Dr. Gopal Goswami, chairman, GAP Group, said semiconductor manufacturing, data centres and transport infrastructure are beginning to create demand for housing, commercial spaces, hospitality, co-working and industrial real estate in Dholera.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/dholera-no-longer-speculative-manufacturing-to-drive-real-estate-demand-gopal-goswami/133565920?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-186236/133565920.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Ahmedabad: Nod for Hansol town planning scheme 67; to transform eastern riverfront skyline", "para": "After a long wait of 24 years, Hansol TP Scheme No. 67 has finally received preliminary approval, paving the way for development on over 50 hectares of land near the iconic Taj hotel and the picturesque Sabarmati Riverfront. This significant progress allows the civic body to initiate road construction and grant development permissions, reshaping the eastern riverfront skyline with new architectural projects and enhancing connectivity through a proposed tunnel alignment.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/ahmedabad-nod-for-hansol-town-planning-scheme-67-to-transform-eastern-riverfront-skyline/133555920?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-45258/133555920.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}, {"title": "Nagpur: Kachipura survey to map 800 properties ahead of proposed BKC-style hub", "para": "The Nagpur district administration is pushing for a fresh socio-economic survey in Kachipura. This initiative aims to gather essential data on residents and properties before the redevelopment of key land. The decision comes in light of the state government's stance on unauthorized structures, with the findings expected to shape Kachipura's evolution into a vibrant commercial center.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/nagpur-kachipura-survey-to-map-800-properties-ahead-of-proposed-bkc-style-hub/133555873?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-31002/133555873.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}]}